    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Awesome FAQ</strong> is a lightweight, user-friendly WordPress plugin that lets you create beautiful and responsive FAQ sections using <strong>Gutenberg Blocks</strong> or <strong>shortcodes</strong>.<br />\nPerfect for bloggers, business owners, online shops, portfolios, and anyone who needs a simple and elegant way to display frequently asked questions.</p>\n<p>To boost your website’s SEO, the plugin now supports FAQ Schema (JSON-LD).<br />\nWith just one click, your FAQs can be marked up with Google-recommended structured data, increasing the chances of rich results in search engines and improving overall visibility.<br />\nGutenberg users will enjoy the built-in block support, while classic editor users can easily embed FAQs using shortcodes—giving you full flexibility.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://demo.bplugins.com/demo/all-demos-in-one-place/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Live Demos</a> | <a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/faq-and-answers/pricing/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pricing</a> | <a href=\"https://bplugins.com/support/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support</a> |  <a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/faq-and-answers/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Awesome FAQ</a></p>\n<h3>⭐ Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>6 <strong>Free</strong> modern FAQ themes  </li>\n<li>3 <strong>Premium</strong> FAQ themes in Pro  </li>\n<li>Fully responsive on all devices<br />\n-Two Column FAQ and Horizontal FAQ</li>\n<li>Gutenberg Block support  </li>\n<li>Shortcode support for any page or widget  </li>\n<li>Smooth animations</li>\n<li>FAQ Schema SEO  </li>\n<li>Fast and lightweight  </li>\n<li>Extremely easy to use—no coding needed  </li>\n<li>100% ad-free</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🔥 Pro Features</h3>\n<p>Upgrade to the Pro version for full customization:<br />\n&#8211; More premium FAQ templates<br />\n&#8211; Category and Filter FAQ add<br />\n&#8211; Search FAQ Options<br />\n&#8211; MultiColumn FAQ Add<br />\n&#8211; Color, icon, spacing &amp; typography controls<br />\n&#8211; Additional layouts &amp; animation effects<br />\n&#8211; Ideal for agencies and professional websites</p>\n<h3>How To Use</h3>\n<p>Awesome FAQ provides two easy ways to add FAQs to your website: <strong>Gutenberg Block</strong> and <strong>Shortcode</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>1. Using Gutenberg Block</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the WordPress Block/Gutenberg Editor on any page or post.</li>\n<li>Click the <strong>Add Block</strong> (+) button.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>Awesome FAQ</strong> in the block directory.</li>\n<li>Click on the block to add it to your content.</li>\n<li>Customize the FAQ section using the block settings:\n<ul>\n<li>Choose a theme (free or Pro)</li>\n<li>Set colors, icons, typography, and toggle options</li>\n<li>Add questions and answers</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Preview and publish your page. Your FAQ section is now live!</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>2. Using Shortcode (via Custom Post Type)</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>In the WordPress dashboard, go to <strong>Awesome FAQ <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New FAQ</strong>.</li>\n<li>Enter your question and answer for each FAQ item.</li>\n<li>Assign categories or groups if needed (for multiple FAQ sections).</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Publish</strong> to save the FAQ item.</li>\n<li>Copy the <strong>generated shortcode</strong> displayed on the page.</li>\n<li>Paste the shortcode into any post, page, or widget where you want the FAQ to appear.</li>\n<li>Save and preview to see your FAQs in action.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<p>Love the plugin? Want new features? Need support?<br />\nWe’d love to hear from you:<br />\n📩 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/support/\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Send your feedback</a></strong></p>\n<h4>⭐ Check out our other WordPress Plugins</h4>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://audioplayerwp.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Audio Player</a></strong> – Best audio player plugin for WordPress.<br />\n🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://wpvideoplayer.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Video Player</a></strong> – Fully customizable video player plugin.<br />\n🔥 <strong><a href=\"http://pdfposter.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF Poster</a></strong> – Display PDFs beautifully on your website.<br />\n🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/streamcast\" rel=\"ugc\">StreamCast</a></strong> – Powerful radio player plugin.<br />\n🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://3d-viewer.bplugins.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">3D Viewer</a></strong> – Display interactive 3D models easily.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>From Gutenberg Editor:<br />\n1. Go to the WordPress Block/Gutenberg Editor<br />\n2. Search for the Block Directory<br />\n3. Click on the Block Directory to add the block</p>\n<p>Download &amp; Upload:<br />\n1. Download the Awesome FAQ plugin (faq-and-answers.zip file)<br />\n2. In your admin area, go to the Plugins menu and click on Add New<br />\n3. Click on Upload Plugin and choose the faq-and-answer.zip file<br />\n4. Click Install Now, then Activate the plugin, and enjoy!</p>\n<p>Manually:<br />\n1. Download and upload the Awesome FAQ plugin to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory<br />\n2. Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"i%20don%27t%20know%20coding.%20can%20i%20use%20the%20plugin%20%3F\">\nI don&#8217;t know coding. can i use the plugin ?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You don&#8217;t have any coding knowledge to use the plugin</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20the%20plugin%20contain%20any%20ad%3F\">\nIs the plugin contain any ad?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, the plugin does not show any ad.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20many%20faq%20area%20can%20i%20create%20%3F\">\nHow many faq area can i create ?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>There is no limit, you can create unlimited questions and answers.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20do%20i%20report%20security%20bugs%20found%20in%20this%20plugin%3F\">\nWhere do I report security bugs found in this plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Please report security bugs found in the source code of the Awesome FAQ plugin through the Patchstack Vulnerability Disclosure Program. The Patchstack team will assist you with verification, CVE assignment, and notify the developers of this plugin.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.5 &#8211; 2026-03-03</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add new Dashboard.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.4 &#8211; 2026-01-18</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add FAQ Schema (JSON-LD).</li>\n<li>Fully compatible with Google Rich Results (FAQ rich snippet).</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.3 &#8211; 2025-12-23</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add new template.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.2 &#8211; 2025-12-03</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduced PHP code.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.1 &#8211; 2025-12-01</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add new template &amp; smooth open/close animations. Performance &amp; bug fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0 &#8211; 2025-11-24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated with new a lot features and major updates of the plugin</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.2 &#8211; 2024-12-12</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Security Issue</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix issue and make compatible with WordPress 5.5 Version</li>\n<li>Fix other php warning</li>\n<li>Add Shortcode on Add New FAQ page</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create responsive FAQ sections, toggle content, and multiple accordion-style question groups effortlessly on your WordPress site.",
